msgid "** While the default here is GPS, the port is inverted so this won't work with a GPS, it was intended for use with FrSky receivers for telemetry.  Usually :ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` should be set to an FrSky protocol and a diode tied from TX (anode) to RX and attached to the SPort of an FrSky receiver.Alternatively, :ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` can be set to 2, to disable the inverters for normal use."
msgstr ""

